{"id":1050302,"chapter_id":1050302,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"BR-000外的基站下，你带上了呼吸口罩，气孔处随着你的呼吸，混杂着点点蓝色的粉尘，飘散在脸颊旁。\n远处传来的怪物的低吼，让本就焦灼的气氛更为凝滞。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"接到求援信息后，你带着一小队警员立刻动身前往破碎防线。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"而迎接你们的，是数十具普通穿着的尸体，和一言不发的巡护队员。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"options":["这些人是？"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302004,"trial_step":4,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这些人是？","goto":5}]},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？？","content":"试图袭击破碎防线的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"为首的人身穿FAC的特制制服，站出来回答你的问题。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"科尔","content":"我是科尔，这队……这里的老大。啊，就是负责人，队长，他们习惯这么喊我了。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"科尔","content":"躺在地上的这帮人，说政府抢占了他们的生存资源，让他们过得生不如死。并且坚信政府的资源都在这个基站护着的大罩子里。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"科尔","content":"他们……说是来夺回这些的。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"民间确实一直有流传过这样的说法。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"但我想这应该不能成为杀掉他们的理由。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"你皱着眉头，看了看科尔。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"科尔","content":"他们说基站上安装了东西让他们整夜整夜地睡不着，于是纠集了一帮不知道是为了看热闹还是真的被说服的人一起冲了过来。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"科尔","content":"声称这里的基站都是我们为了防止民众靠近并且驱逐他们而安置的。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"科尔","content":"别看他们打扮得不过是些平民百姓的模样，实际衣服下面，都藏着刀和枪。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"options":["交代来意与规则"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302016,"trial_step":16,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"交代来意与规则","goto":17}]},{"step":17,"content":"我是MBCC的局长，接到消息称这里M值提升，有可能遇上死役或是禁闭者的袭击，被叫来进行支援的。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"为了避免狂厄的进一步扩散，这些人理应由我决定M值是否到达临界点之后再做处理。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"况且，就算是尸体……也具有狂厄污染的可能性。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"科尔","content":"你是……MBCC的局长？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"科尔摸了摸胸前发着光的三角异方晶，多看了你两眼。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"是的。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"你命令警员与破碎防线的人一起维持秩序，并开始查看尸体是否有感染可能。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"FAC警员","content":"局长，基站发射的力场防护罩有被袭击的痕迹。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"FAC警员","content":"但看上去并没有使用狂厄武器……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"闻言，你放下正在查看的尸体，勘察了一下破碎防线上的基站防护装置——上面磨损的痕迹，更像是异邦和辛迪加黑市惯用和流通的刀枪。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"奇怪……","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"破碎防线是BR-0000最薄弱的防护线，内海压抑的氛围像是能透过基站的防护罩淹没你们一般，让人不住地焦躁和反胃。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"这样的地方，普通人绝不会因为这样的理由就跑过来——并且，这些伤痕和尸体上的伤痕，明显出自相同的武器。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"尸体上的伤口并非FAC配置的武器造成的，你们不是——！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"科尔","content":"反应还挺快啊……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"转身的一瞬间，你的额头抵上了一支冰冷的枪管。而你带来的人，也被悄无声息地控制住了。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"科尔","content":"听这些尸体说，这些基站归一个什么局管，而你正好又是局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"科尔","content":"懂事的话，乖乖打开这个玩意儿。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"科尔","content":"否则……你也会变成那堆里的一员。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"options":["断然拒绝"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302036,"trial_step":36,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"断然拒绝","goto":37}]},{"step":37,"content":"基站隔绝的是死亡和污染！里面没有你想要的东西！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"贸然打开只会让你们感染加深！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"科尔","content":"这么说……你是不愿意配合了？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"科尔以眼神示意他手下的人，那些人早在你安排巡查时，就伺机跟在所有警员身边。一声令下后，他们极其熟练地就将刀插入防护服脆弱的缝隙里，干脆地解决掉了你带来的警员。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"FAC警员","content":"啊啊啊——！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"一股腥气霎时间汹涌而来，内海像是感受到了这股味道似的，明明什么都看不见，却像巨浪滔天一般翻涌着让人感到压迫和恐惧。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"你！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"还未等说出什么话来，你只觉得眼前一黑，手掌膝盖皆被粗粝的碎石磨破——科尔将你狠狠地摔在地上，踩在废墟上俯视着你。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"科尔","content":"哟，骨头挺硬的嘛，让我看看你能硬气到什么时候。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"科尔转过身去，对准破碎防线，一连开了好几枪。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"给我住手！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"options":["朝科尔开枪","上前阻止"],"style":6,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302048,"trial_step":48,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"朝科尔开枪","goto":49},{"text":"上前阻止","goto":56}]},{"step":49,"content":"子弹穿破科尔的手掌，但并没有流出鲜血。取而代之的是一股散发着臭味的浓稠液体……","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"你果然已经狂厄化了！！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"科尔","content":"啊……在内海游荡了这么久，怎么可能不被恶魔眷顾呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"科尔","content":"但我很中意这样的力量……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"科尔","content":"你在害怕吗？MBCC的局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"这股力量你们是无法掌控的，最后只会感染得越来越深，最后被它们侵蚀！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"科尔一脚踢飞你手中的枪，一挥手，把你狠狠地砸在基站的防护装置上。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302055,"trial_step":55,"next":[63]},{"step":56,"content":"你不顾疼痛，抽出自己的枪，跑上前去抵住科尔的心脏。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"科尔","content":"呵……到底是MBCC的人，还有几分胆量啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"科尔","content":"可惜，你杀不死现在的我。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"科尔露出阴险的表情，将身体朝你顶去。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"科尔","content":"来啊，开枪啊。哦……我好像刚才听我们的局长大人说过，不管是什么人，都要得到你的认可，才能被杀死？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"你看着科尔扭曲的面孔，刚才那些黑乎乎的液体喷溅到他的防护服上，防护服中间，那颗蓝色的异方三角，飞速地缩小，变红——他已经没有救了。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"科尔抓住你迟疑的一瞬间，将你的头狠狠地砸在了基站上。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"科尔","content":"不配合也没关系，这一步我们本来就打算做。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"从头皮传来的剧痛延伸到尾椎骨，科尔拽着你的头发将你掼倒在地。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"他命人拿起枪甚至是小型火炮，对着破碎防线开始轰炸。基站的裂痕逐渐延伸，发出让人兴奋的脆裂声，罩住内海的力场，开始变得脆弱。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"住手！！！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"身上的伤口撕裂般疼痛，但你管不了这么多了，你按下通讯器，要求总部立刻支援，同时抓起身边不知是从哪具尸体上掉下来的武器，朝科尔频频射击。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"科尔","content":"哈！这不痛不痒的攻击！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"科尔","content":"你真的是什么局长吗？不如换我来当吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"科尔迎着你的所有攻击，飞快地靠近你，一只手掐住你的脖子，将你拎起，压在了附近废弃的雕像上。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"科尔","content":"哈哈哈……哈哈哈！！你感受到我的力量了吗！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"科尔","content":"少给我做这些白费力气的事，等我们打开了入口，我还得让你带队呢……不然……现在就杀了你也不是不行。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"被紧掐住脖子，喉咙中的空气越来越稀少，眼前的事物陷入模糊。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"你几乎认为你就要被他掐死在这座废弃的雕像上时，一抹艳丽的颜色进入了你的视野。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"？？？","content":"瞧瞧，是谁深陷囹圄，困于高塔……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我可怜的小怪物，别怕……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"科尔","content":"女人？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"科尔抬头看着立在雕像上的女人，兜帽遮住了她的眼睛，看不真切。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"科尔","content":"这就是你的救援？就这个女人？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"观星者","content":"对付嗷嗷叫唤的畜生，就算只有我一个人……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"观星者","content":"也足够了。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"科尔","content":"你说什——？！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"未等科尔说完，几道黑色的光球炸在科尔脸上，迫使他放开了双手。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"观星者","content":"哼，闻闻那边的味儿吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"女人手中飞出一张塔罗牌，直直地插在了他们疯狂轰炸的防护薄弱之处。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"原本只是布满裂痕的基站，被这么一砸，似乎停滞了一瞬，让防护力场露出了些许伤口，而那一瞬，所有人都透过这些缺口，看到了暗黑与殷红交错中的点点蓝色光芒，像车矢菊色的蓝宝石一样。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"走私贩成员","content":"头儿！！异方晶……是异方晶！！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"科尔","content":"哈哈哈哈！我猜的果然没错！！这里面储存着大量的异方晶！！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"科尔看到那抹蓝色，眼睛涨得通红，顾不得自己头上流出的血，发疯似的朝缺口走去。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"不……咳咳……不行，你们已经……已经……","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"观星者","content":"小怪物，你要去哪里？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"站在高处的人，一跃而下，抓着你一起看着基站那边涌动的人和黑烟。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"他们就像是闻到血腥味的蛭虫，贪婪地吮吸着从内海溢出的丝丝气味。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"观星者","content":"异方晶的味道，死亡的味道，金钱的味道……","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"观星者","content":"对于亡命之徒来说，死亡远不及金钱。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"我知道……他们是来自异邦的异方晶走私犯。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"观星者","content":"我的小怪物，你早就猜出来了？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"观星者","content":"不过，看他们这样子，用不了多久，应该就会暴毙了吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"不行，咳咳……不能让他们打开防护罩！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"辛迪加存在的异方晶，都是被狂厄所污染的！既然他们以此为生，那他们早就被那些异方晶所感染了！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"我们早知内海一直游荡着一批鬼一般的走私犯……没想到……在这里遇上了……","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"他们的M值已经到达临界，再这么靠近……会完全异化为死役的！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"科尔","content":"滚开！！！我来砸碎他！你们这些废物！！！哈哈哈哈！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"失去理智的科尔将自己的手下的狠狠推开。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"身后的废弃雕像布满尖锐的碎石，科尔丝毫不关心摔上去的后果如何，他的眼里，只有异方晶。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"观星者","content":"他们欺骗了你，你还要救他们吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"观星者","content":"他们贪婪，狡诈……披上羊皮欺骗无辜的人。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"观星者","content":"他们残忍，无知……自己挖掘埋葬自己的坟墓。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"观星者","content":"你明明在砂海时，毁灭了这样的人，为什么现在要帮他们？为什么要救他们？","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"这算不上帮他们。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"观星者","content":"高塔已经立起，所有人都逃不过世界的制裁，这样的人更是不会苟活到最后一刻。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"但在灾难面前，所有人都将是平等的。","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"基站若是被毁，内海危机将再度升级！到时候，殃及的又何止是这一队士兵！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"我不可能——！！！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"你做什么——！","style":2,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"观星者提着你的领子，重新将你压制在雕像上。你心下一惊，本能地想要使用枷锁——可是不远处，内海像就等着你在它面前释放枷锁一样，兴奋地翻涌着。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"枷锁的波动，让你的大脑深处嗡鸣，叫嚣着让你警惕，警惕内海的引诱，警惕……眼前的人。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"观星者","content":"我的占卜，我的预言……不会那么轻易就被打破。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"观星者","content":"这是必然的结果，局长，你不可能改变的。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"观星者","content":"当然……你也可以选择，用枷锁束缚我，去主导自己的命运。","voice":["vo_trial_50302_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150302121,"trial_step":121}]}